# `storage/local/` (without a leading `**/`) only matches at the repo root in gitignore
# semantics — the actual local attachment storage lives under apps/web/ (STORAGE_LOCAL_DIR
# resolves relative to the Next.js process's cwd), so it needs its own, depth-agnostic entry.
